Behavior:
- Flags and positionals mix in any order. `--` ends flag parsing. Bare `-` is positional.
- Value flag takes next argument even if it starts with `-`, so `--count -3` works.
- Bool accepts explicit value only with `=`: `--shout=false`.
- No short-flag bundling: `-sc` is an unknown flag.
- `-h` and `--help` reserved. Bad definitions (duplicate, reserved, required positional after optional) panic at setup.

